  "name": "Good Night, Dear Thundercoil",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/Good_Night,_Dear_Thundercoil",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-08-03T10:35:34.700Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Arcadian Calendar ████████ — Fulwish TV Staff Support System (Ver. β) Operational Log"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-ab60ea34cd26607b"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "██:00 \"Arcadia News\" Rerun"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "██:06 Abnormal behavior and Wishpower readings detected in TV Station staff member \"thundercoil.\" No correlation found with any existing records saved."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Auto-soothing protocol activated. Attempted communication via internal broadcast. No meaningful response received. Protocol 1: ineffective."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "██:07 Attempted to trace imagenesis-related medical histories. Attempted concurrently with Protocol 2, Wishpower cookie deposited into feeding slot."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "██:12 Cookie ignored by the staff member. Protocol 2: ineffective."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "██:13 Staff member exhibited convulsive symptoms, accompanied by a severe Wishpower fluctuation condition."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "██:15 Final Protocol \"Manual Service\" initiated. Notification dispatched to this system's developer. Audio log is as follows:"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-90aea7ea38c9d48d"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:00:03 *arcadia slang*! What the heck is going on out there!? Something's off about the moon, a giant die is filling every screen. Is this the end of the world?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:00:08 *howl*"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:00:09 Thundercoil, my dude!? Did you just... full-on swallow those wispae!?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:00:10 *indeterminate howling*"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:00:13 C—C'mon thundercoil, snap out of it..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:00:17 *thunderclap*"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:00:18 *Sound of rocks shattering*"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:00:30 Ha, ha, ha! You missed! I'm still alive! No, no, I don't want to die."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:00:35 I've still got a plan, yes, yes the Director taught me about it."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:00:41 Words have the power to soothe, yes, I just need to, yes, to somehow, empathize."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:00:47 \"Calm down, thundercoil, my bro!! I brought you Wishpower cookies!\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:00:58 *howling, accompanied by the wind*"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:01:03 *arcadia slang* Argh, it's gone completely berserk!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:01:10 \"Thundercoil!! Listen to me!\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:01:16 \"I brought you Wishpower cookies!! Thundercoil, my bro. I know everything that's going on around you inevitably makes you feel insecure!\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:01:25 \"It's okay, you're safe! Nobody here wants to hurt you!\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:01:50 *silence, wind rustling*"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:01:58 D—Did it work? There's no more thunder!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:02:00 Hey! Heh heh! I knew the Director was right! I'm okay! I'm going to be okay!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:02:06 That's right, thundercoil. The Security Bureau's definitely on it, the heroes from the Astral Express too. They'll figure something out! It'll be fine!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:02:16 *silence, accompanied by low, heavy exhalation*"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:02:20 Y—You don't have to respond. Just focus on calming down."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:02:25 And don't worry, thundercoil, remember what Director Fulwish told us? As long as we truly believe it, deep inside,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:02:29 then all of us will f—find \"Happiness\"..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:02:30 *enraged howl*"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:02:31 *thunderclap*"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:02:32 Wh—What? Thun—"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "00:02:32 *shatter*"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-118e97ae81e29f38"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "An electrical current has been detected flowing from the developer's device to the main server. The system will temporarily enter Safe Mode to mitigate any potential threats."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "End of Record"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-996789f2ccb609de"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
